COMPOSITION
New optics.js, motion.js, layout.js, hud.js and film.js implement the optical rendering and full narrative. The published physical material formulas, measured camera/layout data and exact script guide the recreation. No original archive scene or render module is imported. Generic core/lib.js supplies interpolation and easing only.

FONTS
IBM Plex Mono and IBM Plex Sans (IBM); Noto Sans SC and Noto Serif SC (Google/Adobe). SIL Open Font License 1.1, local fonts and four licence files supplied. Acquisition: fetch_fonts.py from Google Fonts.

VOICE
Fresh Kokoro-82M bm_george, exact seven original lines at the original per-line speed directions. Root owns synthesis and ASR. Kokoro Apache-2.0; kokoro-onnx MIT.

MUSIC AND SOUND
New 90 BPM piano/chamber/glass score following the original full musical direction, with three explicit rest ranges. Piano: Salamander Grand Piano V3 by Alexander Holm, CC BY 3.0 https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/ . Strings, contrabass, glass, timpani, suspended cymbal and bowed vibraphone: VSCO-2 CE, VCSL and FreePats CC0 via core/audio/sampler.py. New deterministic ballast hum, loupe contact, paper sweeps, pen, ticks, wind and surf via root foley renderer.

